      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think `PerformDependencyWalk` is still called in\nhttps://source.chromium.org/gn/gn/+/main:src/gn/header_checker.cc;l\u003d462;drc\u003dc0e4aae6d809a08cd402432a7d23494fc3b2a776\nBut if calling `permitted\u003dtrue` case only is better, can we leave comment about that here?",
